        <section class="panel" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
          <h2 id="about-title">About</h2>
          <div class="about-overview">
            <p>Wayfinder is a responsive, CSS-led navigation demo built to make moving around a website feel clear and welcoming. It works as a standalone page, and can optionally load menu data from an Express endpoint.</p>
            <div class="feature-grid">
              <article class="feature-card"><h3>Responsive menus</h3><p>Header dropdowns, a two-column mega-menu, and a slide-in mobile drawer adapt to your screen.</p></article>
              <article class="feature-card"><h3>Find your place</h3><p>Section links, breadcrumbs, and active states help show where you are and where to go next.</p></article>
              <article class="feature-card"><h3>Useful destinations</h3><p>Open curated reference, shopping, browser, and AI websites from one link directory.</p></article>
              <article class="feature-card"><h3>Accessible by design</h3><p>Keyboard-friendly controls, clear focus indicators, labelled landmarks, and reduced-motion support are built in.</p></article>
              <article class="feature-card"><h3>Customizable menus</h3><p>One JSON menu configuration powers the header, sidebar, and mobile drawer, with a built-in fallback.</p></article>
              <article class="feature-card"><h3>Personal touch</h3><p>CSS-only tabs, emoji ratings, contact cards, and an About note saved locally in your browser.</p></article>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="about-editor">
            <label for="about-copy">Your Wayfinder note</label>
            <p>Add a short introduction or message for visitors. It is saved only in this browser.</p>
            <textarea id="about-copy" placeholder="Write a short introduction about your organization, team, or work."></textarea>
            <p id="about-save-status" aria-live="polite">Your text saves automatically on this device.</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel" id="reviews" aria-labelledby="reviews-title">
